				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;float-right&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/architecture-of-value-001-value-construction-protocol-the-architecture-of-context-pivtorak-studio-2026.webp&#34; alt=&#34;Value Construction Protocol: The Architecture of Context&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;∀ ◉ ∃ Architecture of Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;value-construction-protocol-the-architecture-of-context&#34;&gt;Value Construction Protocol: The Architecture of Context&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#value-construction-protocol-the-architecture-of-context&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;0-status--identification&#34;&gt;0. Status &amp;amp; Identification&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#0-status--identification&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Conceptual / Applied Protocol (White Paper)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Theory, Cultural Economics, Systems Design&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Author:&lt;/strong&gt; Pivtorak Studio&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Version:&lt;/strong&gt; v0.1 (Foundational Layer)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-core-shift&#34;&gt;1. Core Shift&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#1-core-shift&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From:&lt;/strong&gt; Valuation of existing objects.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To:&lt;/strong&gt; Construction of value systems and future asset states.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote class=&#39;book-hint &#39;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We do not evaluate objects. We design the conditions under which value emerges, persists, and scales.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
